# T312 vendored OpenCV.js WASM asset manifest
#
# Custom build of official OpenCV 4.12.0 (tag commit 49486f61fb25722cbcf586b7f4320921d46fb38e)
# with the JS whitelist extended by features2d SIFT + core dct. Built with emsdk 4.0.10
# and CMake 3.31.6: `--build_wasm --disable_single_file`, Emscripten `-s WASM=1
# -s USE_PTHREADS=0`. Build recipe: web/tools/opencv/build_opencv_sift.sh; whitelist:
# web/tools/opencv/opencv_js_sift.config.py; full provenance: web/tools/opencv/PROVENANCE.md.
#
# These are the only committed runtime artifacts (no toolchains/archives/build trees).
